{"title":"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution1_(Clever_Manipulations)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution1 (Clever Manipulations)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The solution of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48de8e61c1c6065c2944d909d7343bd8c40a41cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{x+7} = 8^x$\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> can be expressed in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/b/41bf9e256ab9b3dc393cc5d4434fd349a26eb204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\log_b 7^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"19\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97aed20a1943ea7b60c42d6ff01ce1e9e328d13e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{7}{15} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{7}{8} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{8}{7} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{15}{8} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{15}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"394\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This problem is quickly solved with knowledge of the laws of exponents and logarithms.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa23781e0e01f1f8fdbe183ef0893c6290e8121c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 7^{x+7} &amp;= 8^x \\\\  7^x*7^7 &amp;= 8^x \\\\  \\left(\\frac{8}{7}\\right)^x &amp;= 7^7 \\\\  x &amp;= \\log_{8/7}7^7 \\end{align*}\" width=\"137\" height=\"128\" />\n</p><p>Since we are looking for the base of the logarithm, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/65822f94f334a55d3479eff98db488ca0fa8c79c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{8}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"59\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, take the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/7/5373fb8b2b89ea712aac8fd880bcf197153d3620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"33\" height=\"19\" /> of both sides, which gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/993046dfdb0303c4128b051322033a42defaa5a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+7=\\log_{7}8^x=x\\log_{7}8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"200\" height=\"19\" />. We move the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> terms to 1 side. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/3/8731857933f93de69e3a7e87ac65834f73d791a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(\\log_{7}8-1)=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" />. Isolate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and manipulate the answer. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f0b25e9b500dccbfe6957c57aa97a619f062209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{7}{\\log_{7}\\frac{8}{7}}=7\\log_{\\frac{8}{7}}7=\\log_{\\frac{8}{7}}7^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"245\" height=\"45\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a136d7da7fc80875e3e3a288d74873208a966a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{7}=\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"62\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution1_.28Clever_Manipulations.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution1_(Clever_Manipulations)\">Video Solution1 (Clever Manipulations)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution1 (Clever Manipulations)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xGeL7864QLM\">https://youtu.be/xGeL7864QLM</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A\">2010 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"